{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOXU</strong> is an <strong>IN-DEVELOPMENT</strong> French indie fighting game. It's a <strong>2V2 TAG FIGHTER</strong>, so you'll need a friend to team up with <strong>BUT</strong> we've got your back ; You only need <strong>one</strong> copy of the game.<br>Also, there is a sick co-op story mode to discover fighting games and the world of <strong>Tetratalma</strong>. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/867bb79107fdaa807216eafa26435496.avif?t=1756980439\" width=421 height=458 /></span><br><strong><u>6 BUTTONS CONTROLS</u></strong> <br>Far more than enough to create cool combos and deep neutral. Gatling system and special cancels, traditional motion inputs and a native modern controls scheme <br><br><strong><u>18 CHARACTERS</u></strong> <br>Some of the best characters ever made, like Kenny. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/a502234ff2c6b00e1e5c77f6384b12f4.avif?t=1756980439\" width=773 height=484 /></span><br><br><strong><u>ONLINE RANKED AND LOCAL VERSUS</u></strong><br>Team up with a friend or a random, to fight randoms. Then a high level AI will judge your rank. If you have four randoms at home, you can play with them in local.\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/02dd7ebb63a1124d47b8b40b93d2ffe0.avif?t=1756980439\" width=240 height=341 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/7a36c90e6dbd96b3dc841bae21083683.avif?t=1756980439\" width=275 height=362 /></span><br><br><strong><u>STORY MODE</u></strong> <br>Are you and your teammate really friends ? Play this gut-wrenching story and put your trusts on the line. <br>Play as Izan and Sadara, two soon-to-be mages as they travel the world looking for answers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/a8b01d29398231d6e9c58d74b01fa037.avif?t=1756980439\" width=222 height=319 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/7376be1fbd09c4bf6ec51da7f1e82a0f.avif?t=1756980439\" width=166 height=301 /></span><br><br>Face your foes and your fears, in co-op fights and solo trauma.Powerful bosses, deep dialogues, proximity chat, treason, cool music, a smooth learning curve, and a picture of my cat.\u00a0 <br><br>Finally, the story mode all you FGC folks were waiting for :) <br><br><br><strong><u>TRAINING MODE</u></strong> <br>Quality of life features everywhere : state records, dummy settings, gauge settings, reset settings, all the settings.<br>Playable solo or with a friend, local or online. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/0fc53d0a717200c7fd24111143d08b97.avif?t=1756980439\" width=264 height=321 /></span><br><br><strong><u>JUKEBOX</u></strong><br> Set whatever cool music you want on whatever cool stage you want.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883600?t=1756980439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/af9dcc242baa687af089a82ad5d3a8cec55ad3d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756980439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/ab0f75d2ec92fe204e3efa750c9298b16641a518/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756980439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/ab0f75d2ec92fe204e3efa750c9298b16641a518/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756980439","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOXU</strong> is an <strong>IN-DEVELOPMENT</strong> French indie fighting game. It's a <strong>2V2 TAG FIGHTER</strong>, so you'll need a friend to team up with <strong>BUT</strong> we've got your back ; You only need <strong>one</strong> copy of the game.<br>Also, there is a sick co-op story mode to discover fighting games and the world of <strong>Tetratalma</strong>. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/867bb79107fdaa807216eafa26435496.avif?t=1756980439\" width=421 height=458 /></span><br><strong><u>6 BUTTONS CONTROLS</u></strong> <br>Far more than enough to create cool combos and deep neutral. Gatling system and special cancels, traditional motion inputs and a native modern controls scheme <br><br><strong><u>18 CHARACTERS</u></strong> <br>Some of the best characters ever made, like Kenny. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/a502234ff2c6b00e1e5c77f6384b12f4.avif?t=1756980439\" width=773 height=484 /></span><br><br><strong><u>ONLINE RANKED AND LOCAL VERSUS</u></strong><br>Team up with a friend or a random, to fight randoms. Then a high level AI will judge your rank. If you have four randoms at home, you can play with them in local.\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/02dd7ebb63a1124d47b8b40b93d2ffe0.avif?t=1756980439\" width=240 height=341 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/7a36c90e6dbd96b3dc841bae21083683.avif?t=1756980439\" width=275 height=362 /></span><br><br><strong><u>STORY MODE</u></strong> <br>Are you and your teammate really friends ? Play this gut-wrenching story and put your trusts on the line. <br>Play as Izan and Sadara, two soon-to-be mages as they travel the world looking for answers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/a8b01d29398231d6e9c58d74b01fa037.avif?t=1756980439\" width=222 height=319 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/7376be1fbd09c4bf6ec51da7f1e82a0f.avif?t=1756980439\" width=166 height=301 /></span><br><br>Face your foes and your fears, in co-op fights and solo trauma.Powerful bosses, deep dialogues, proximity chat, treason, cool music, a smooth learning curve, and a picture of my cat.\u00a0 <br><br>Finally, the story mode all you FGC folks were waiting for :) <br><br><br><strong><u>TRAINING MODE</u></strong> <br>Quality of life features everywhere : state records, dummy settings, gauge settings, reset settings, all the settings.<br>Playable solo or with a friend, local or online. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883600/extras/0fc53d0a717200c7fd24111143d08b97.avif?t=1756980439\" width=264 height=321 /></span><br><br><strong><u>JUKEBOX</u></strong><br> Set whatever cool music you want on whatever cool stage you want.\u00a0</p>","developers":["DeadBat Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"